openwiki/quickstart.md:40:- **Installation and rebuilds:** [README bootstrap](../README.md#bootstrap) and [recovery](../README.md#recovery) are the command authority. Follow them directly; this page does not maintain a second bootstrap recipe. Applying the bootstrap manifest alone is not a complete cluster installation: prerequisite CNI, ESO, Longhorn, and non-HA ArgoCD installation comes first.
openwiki/quickstart.md:41:- **Reconciliation entrypoint:** [bootstrap/bootstrap.yaml](../bootstrap/bootstrap.yaml) creates the `root` Application in `argocd`, tracking this repository's `main` branch at `apps/`. [apps/root.yaml](../apps/root.yaml) declares the wave-ordered platform Applications; standalone Application YAML in `apps/` is also discovered. This is an App of Apps graph, not one flat Helm release.
